1
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

2
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:10,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I may as well have not existed.</b></font>

3
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:11,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back then,</b></font>

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I felt nothing...</b></font>

5
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and thought nothing.</b></font>

6
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:18,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to change.</b></font>

7
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:20,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Each time,</b></font>

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my wishes died
without coming true.</b></font>

9
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one felt anything
when I was around.</b></font>

10
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:28,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or if they did, it was pity.</b></font>

11
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It hurts.</b></font>

12
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel awful.</b></font>

13
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is this how life is?</b></font>

14
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What could change it?</b></font>

15
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

16
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:41,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

17
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:01,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honey lemon soda.</b></font>

18
00:01:02,810 --> 00:01:04,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What I've been looking for?</b></font>

19
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:06,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was you.</b></font>

20
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:10,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

21
00:01:14,410 --> 00:01:15,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh!</b></font>

22
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:21,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh.
You're up.</b></font>

23
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:24,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He's here.</b></font>

24
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:27,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My mind is fuzzy.</b></font>

25
00:01:27,550 --> 00:01:28,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Am I dreaming?</b></font>

26
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I must be...</b></font>

27
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>just like before.</b></font>

28
00:01:36,050 --> 00:01:37,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura?</b></font>

29
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]
I love you.</b></font>

30
00:01:38,390 --> 00:01:39,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

31
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:40,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
If I'm dreaming,</b></font>

32
00:01:40,850 --> 00:01:42,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can say anything.</b></font>

33
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:44,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to be yours.</b></font>

34
00:01:44,730 --> 00:01:46,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Make me your girlfriend.</b></font>

35
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:48,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

36
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:50,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just a dream.</b></font>

37
00:01:51,110 --> 00:01:52,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How else could this happen?</b></font>

38
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:55,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could I ever be so lucky?</b></font>

39
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>SPARKLE 12 HONEY LEMON SODA</b></font>

40
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:31,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 1]
Morning!</b></font>

41
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 2]
Hey, there.</b></font>

42
00:03:34,090 --> 00:03:35,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Was all that
a dream, yesterday?</b></font>

43
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:36,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

44
00:03:37,930 --> 00:03:39,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 3]
Hey, hey!</b></font>

45
00:03:39,390 --> 00:03:40,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

46
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm!</b></font>

47
00:03:41,810 --> 00:03:43,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL]
Hmm?</b></font>

48
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:45,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No, it wasn't.</b></font>

49
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was real!</b></font>

50
00:03:48,730 --> 00:03:49,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...</b></font>

51
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:50,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I said I love him.
-[AYUMI] Uka.</b></font>

52
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:51,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] I said I love him.
[AYUMI] Uka!</b></font>

53
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:53,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I said I love him!</b></font>

54
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:54,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I said I love him!</b></font>

55
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:56,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And that wasn't all.</b></font>

56
00:03:56,110 --> 00:03:57,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It gets worse!</b></font>

57
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to be yours.</b></font>

58
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:00,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Make me your girlfriend.</b></font>

59
00:04:00,950 --> 00:04:02,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I said the quiet part
out loud... -[AYUMI] Hello.</b></font>

60
00:04:02,370 --> 00:04:03,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Earth to Uka?
-...straight to his face!</b></font>

61
00:04:03,830 --> 00:04:06,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And if that wasn't bad enough,
I passed out right after.</b></font>

62
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:09,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] Whoa!
-[Uka gasps]</b></font>

63
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:12,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] How could I dream
about that? -Hello?</b></font>

64
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:14,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder.
Did I scare him?</b></font>

65
00:04:14,630 --> 00:04:16,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[indistinct chatter]
-I must have!</b></font>

66
00:04:16,670 --> 00:04:17,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Sup, besties?!</b></font>

67
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:19,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] Uh, Kai?
-[SATORU] Hm?</b></font>

68
00:04:20,550 --> 00:04:22,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Are things gonna
go back to normal?</b></font>

69
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:24,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura.</b></font>

70
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:26,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I love you.</b></font>

71
00:04:26,730 --> 00:04:27,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I love you.</b></font>

72
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...</b></font>

73
00:04:29,650 --> 00:04:30,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

74
00:04:30,770 --> 00:04:32,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] So...
-Hm.</b></font>

75
00:04:32,230 --> 00:04:33,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai.
What'd you do?</b></font>

76
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:37,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What now?</b></font>

77
00:04:37,690 --> 00:04:40,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't go back to "normal."</b></font>

78
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:42,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

79
00:04:42,870 --> 00:04:44,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[leaves rustling]</b></font>

80
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What?!</b></font>

81
00:04:45,370 --> 00:04:47,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You said that?
Like, to him?</b></font>

82
00:04:47,750 --> 00:04:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What have you done with Uka?</b></font>

83
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:50,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[shuddering]</b></font>

84
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:53,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I couldn't keep
it from Ayumi any longer.</b></font>

85
00:04:53,590 --> 00:04:55,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] [excited laughter]
Amazing!</b></font>

86
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go on!
And?</b></font>

87
00:04:57,420 --> 00:04:59,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm? Hm?
More!</b></font>

88
00:04:59,130 --> 00:05:00,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles excitedly]</b></font>

89
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:01,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-More?
-[AYUMI] His reply!</b></font>

90
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, "reply?"</b></font>

91
00:05:03,220 --> 00:05:04,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm-hmm.
Tell me!</b></font>

92
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:06,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not exactly sure.</b></font>

93
00:05:06,810 --> 00:05:08,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was just happy
that I told him.</b></font>

94
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Beyond that, I don't know.</b></font>

95
00:05:10,690 --> 00:05:12,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi chuckles awkwardly]</b></font>

96
00:05:12,190 --> 00:05:13,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
That's so you.</b></font>

97
00:05:13,690 --> 00:05:14,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I guess...</b></font>

98
00:05:14,940 --> 00:05:17,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>typically,
the other person replies?</b></font>

99
00:05:17,570 --> 00:05:18,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] All good, then.
-[Uka gasps]</b></font>

100
00:05:19,190 --> 00:05:22,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But still...I'm sure Kai has
something he wants to say, too.</b></font>

101
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:23,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now is the time.</b></font>

102
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah?</b></font>

103
00:05:25,490 --> 00:05:26,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take the step.</b></font>

104
00:05:28,410 --> 00:05:29,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

105
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:30,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Thank you.
You're right!</b></font>

106
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:33,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Next, I'll talk to him.</b></font>

107
00:05:33,670 --> 00:05:35,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll accept any answer!</b></font>

108
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll be fine.</b></font>

109
00:05:37,340 --> 00:05:38,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is nothing.</b></font>

110
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just another step.</b></font>

111
00:05:40,170 --> 00:05:41,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

112
00:05:41,260 --> 00:05:42,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>3 STEPS FORWARD
2 STEPS BACK</b></font>

113
00:05:42,930 --> 00:05:44,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whoa,
you guys need to see this!</b></font>

114
00:05:44,970 --> 00:05:45,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Over here!</b></font>

115
00:05:46,050 --> 00:05:47,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-Huh?</b></font>

116
00:05:47,930 --> 00:05:48,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Flowers?</b></font>

117
00:05:49,470 --> 00:05:50,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] Remember?
Those third years</b></font>

118
00:05:51,060 --> 00:05:52,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who locked Kai
in the storage room?</b></font>

119
00:05:52,690 --> 00:05:54,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just now, the one with
the two-toned hair</b></font>

120
00:05:54,770 --> 00:05:55,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>left that for you!</b></font>

121
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:57,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] But why?
-[Tonbo laughs]</b></font>

122
00:05:57,230 --> 00:05:59,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] Flowers?
Someone messing with you?</b></font>

123
00:05:59,610 --> 00:06:01,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] Shut it, Tonbo.
-[whimpering]</b></font>

124
00:06:01,610 --> 00:06:03,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] He's got a point.
That might be it.</b></font>

125
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:04,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Well, maybe.</b></font>

126
00:06:04,870 --> 00:06:06,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that doesn't
make any sense!</b></font>

127
00:06:06,830 --> 00:06:07,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.</b></font>

128
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shut it.
You're not scared?</b></font>

129
00:06:09,580 --> 00:06:11,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you don't watch it,
you might get hurt, girl.</b></font>

130
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
Wait, he left a note!</b></font>

131
00:06:15,250 --> 00:06:17,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold on.
If it says anything mean...</b></font>

132
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Death!
Prison!</b></font>

133
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:20,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>UKA ISHIMORI, I LOVE YOU.
NAOKI FROM 3-D</b></font>

134
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:26,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[all gasp, scream]
-[SHIRAISHI] What is this?</b></font>

135
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:28,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] He wrote
a freakin' love letter?</b></font>

136
00:06:28,470 --> 00:06:29,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Oh, my God!
-[SHIRAISHI] Ishimori,</b></font>

137
00:06:29,850 --> 00:06:31,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what'd you say to him?</b></font>

138
00:06:31,350 --> 00:06:33,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] I don't know!
-[AYUMI] You won him over!</b></font>

139
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:34,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
By accident!</b></font>

140
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:36,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] Kai!
Ishimori got a love letter</b></font>

141
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from a third-year!</b></font>

142
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:38,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Wait, for real?</b></font>

143
00:06:39,110 --> 00:06:40,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Huh?</b></font>

144
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why not go out with him?</b></font>

145
00:06:42,690 --> 00:06:44,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not every day you get
a confession from a third-year,</b></font>

146
00:06:44,990 --> 00:06:46,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and it's probably the last one</b></font>

147
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-you'll see for a while!
-[SHIRAISHI] Say what?</b></font>

148
00:06:47,410 --> 00:06:49,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
I hate you so much, Tonbo.</b></font>

149
00:06:49,410 --> 00:06:51,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey.
Why not see if you like him?</b></font>

150
00:06:51,410 --> 00:06:52,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-What's the worst...
-[KAI] Bad idea.</b></font>

151
00:06:52,500 --> 00:06:53,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-...that could happen?
-She's not ready for that.</b></font>

152
00:06:53,790 --> 00:06:54,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right?</b></font>

153
00:06:55,460 --> 00:06:57,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

154
00:06:58,380 --> 00:07:00,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Just think it over carefully.</b></font>

155
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:04,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] Hold up.
What's your deal, Kai?</b></font>

156
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:05,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You totally missed the point.</b></font>

157
00:07:05,630 --> 00:07:07,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's not gonna date him!</b></font>

158
00:07:08,300 --> 00:07:09,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm not ready yet,</b></font>

159
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:11,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>huh?</b></font>

160
00:07:12,930 --> 00:07:14,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

161
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:15,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Oh, come on.</b></font>

162
00:07:15,890 --> 00:07:18,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Did Kai need more fangirls?
-Gets a lotta love</b></font>

163
00:07:18,610 --> 00:07:20,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for being a cheer squad boy.</b></font>

164
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, lucky.</b></font>

165
00:07:21,940 --> 00:07:24,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, why don't we make
a fan club for us?</b></font>

166
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:25,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 4]
...fun together.</b></font>

167
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 5]
It's our treat.</b></font>

168
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Never mind.
Whatever.</b></font>

169
00:07:29,370 --> 00:07:31,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Even the older girls like him.</b></font>

170
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 4]
Gotta look cute!</b></font>

171
00:07:33,450 --> 00:07:35,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Miura's words have weight.</b></font>

172
00:07:35,540 --> 00:07:37,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They always mean something.</b></font>

173
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...</b></font>

174
00:07:39,170 --> 00:07:41,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

175
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:42,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just think it over carefully.</b></font>

176
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:45,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] What could he have meant
when he said that?</b></font>

177
00:07:46,550 --> 00:07:48,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I finally feel comfortable
around him.</b></font>

178
00:07:49,390 --> 00:07:51,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I'm not ready to date him?</b></font>

179
00:07:53,220 --> 00:07:54,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What exactly are we?</b></font>

180
00:07:55,770 --> 00:07:57,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I try to think back,</b></font>

181
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm still where I started.</b></font>

182
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:01,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So was I wrong?</b></font>

183
00:08:01,860 --> 00:08:03,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Should I not have told him
how I felt?</b></font>

184
00:08:03,610 --> 00:08:06,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

185
00:08:07,610 --> 00:08:09,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps receding]</b></font>

186
00:08:10,410 --> 00:08:11,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do I do?</b></font>

187
00:08:12,490 --> 00:08:14,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I told him
I wanted to be his girlfriend.</b></font>

188
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]
I messed up.</b></font>

189
00:08:17,410 --> 00:08:18,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Uka?</b></font>

190
00:08:18,670 --> 00:08:19,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

191
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

192
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:25,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
What happened with Kai?</b></font>

193
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:27,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nothing.</b></font>

194
00:08:27,550 --> 00:08:28,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Let me go talk to him.</b></font>

195
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.</b></font>

196
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] [gasps]
Wait! Please don't!</b></font>

197
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:33,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-But look at you.
-[UKA] It's okay.</b></font>

198
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:37,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't burden him
any more than I have.</b></font>

199
00:08:37,350 --> 00:08:38,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

200
00:08:38,890 --> 00:08:40,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've done enough.</b></font>

201
00:08:40,310 --> 00:08:43,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't make him carry more.
My love is too heavy.</b></font>

202
00:08:44,730 --> 00:08:45,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No.</b></font>

203
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:47,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm falling back on old habits.</b></font>

204
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:50,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

205
00:08:50,780 --> 00:08:53,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, I don't think he wants me
to tell you about this.</b></font>

206
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...</b></font>

207
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the other day?</b></font>

208
00:08:55,290 --> 00:08:56,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After they closed
the storage room?</b></font>

209
00:08:56,790 --> 00:08:59,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

210
00:09:00,580 --> 00:09:01,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[keys jingling]</b></font>

211
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Hey.
-Uh?</b></font>

212
00:09:03,710 --> 00:09:04,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
That the key to the roof?</b></font>

213
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Got lucky.</b></font>

214
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:08,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess it's all mine, now.</b></font>

215
00:09:08,970 --> 00:09:10,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, yeah?
Just like that?</b></font>

216
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:14,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I assume that's gonna be
your new spot to take naps?</b></font>

217
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:16,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You sure love your alone time.</b></font>

218
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:18,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not quite.</b></font>

219
00:09:19,140 --> 00:09:21,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're close,
but I'll invite Ishimori.</b></font>

220
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:22,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

221
00:09:24,230 --> 00:09:25,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] You're scared
you're burdening him,</b></font>

222
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but would Kai say that
if he felt that way?</b></font>

223
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should pay attention.</b></font>

224
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:32,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How's he acted all this time?</b></font>

225
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Go find someone.</b></font>

226
00:09:34,660 --> 00:09:35,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ask for help.</b></font>

227
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:37,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You try to mess with her again,</b></font>

228
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:39,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll be answering to me.</b></font>

229
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you realize
how silly your dreams are?</b></font>

230
00:09:42,290 --> 00:09:43,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're small.</b></font>

231
00:09:43,420 --> 00:09:44,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll make them all come true.</b></font>

232
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:47,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whenever things go wrong,
tell me.</b></font>

233
00:09:47,460 --> 00:09:48,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm with you.</b></font>

234
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:49,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Always.</b></font>

235
00:09:50,090 --> 00:09:51,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ishimori.</b></font>

236
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>C'mere.</b></font>

237
00:09:54,470 --> 00:09:56,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

238
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whoa.
Uh...</b></font>

239
00:09:58,680 --> 00:09:59,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I know what he'll say.</b></font>

240
00:10:00,890 --> 00:10:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Still.
-Ah...</b></font>

241
00:10:02,230 --> 00:10:04,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] I'm scared to hear him
actually say it. -Huh.</b></font>

242
00:10:05,110 --> 00:10:07,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It won't be easy,
and it might hurt,</b></font>

243
00:10:07,730 --> 00:10:08,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but...</b></font>

244
00:10:10,990 --> 00:10:11,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Miura?</b></font>

245
00:10:12,070 --> 00:10:13,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hah.</b></font>

246
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:14,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't like
how this morning went.</b></font>

247
00:10:15,570 --> 00:10:16,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you have the time right now,</b></font>

248
00:10:17,370 --> 00:10:18,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll be in the classroom.</b></font>

249
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:20,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Meet me there!</b></font>

250
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 6] Huh?
Who's she?</b></font>

251
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:25,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I want you to hear my feelings.</b></font>

252
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:26,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Give me the chance...</b></font>

253
00:10:27,250 --> 00:10:28,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>one more time!</b></font>

254
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Let me be able to say it...</b></font>

255
00:10:39,810 --> 00:10:41,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and say it clearly!</b></font>

256
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:43,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

257
00:10:45,100 --> 00:10:46,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

258
00:10:46,650 --> 00:10:48,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This won't be an ending.</b></font>

259
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

260
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:51,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door slides open]</b></font>

261
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:53,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

262
00:10:53,860 --> 00:10:54,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps approaches]</b></font>

263
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

264
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door slides shut]</b></font>

265
00:11:01,660 --> 00:11:04,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

266
00:11:04,830 --> 00:11:06,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Thank you--
-[KAI] Can I go first?</b></font>

267
00:11:07,170 --> 00:11:08,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

268
00:11:08,710 --> 00:11:09,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay.</b></font>

269
00:11:11,090 --> 00:11:12,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did ya think carefully?</b></font>

270
00:11:14,170 --> 00:11:16,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have questions,
so answer honestly.</b></font>

271
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:20,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How do you feel now?</b></font>

272
00:11:20,850 --> 00:11:22,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got your head all sorted out?</b></font>

273
00:11:22,430 --> 00:11:23,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you regret what you said?</b></font>

274
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:26,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or are you ready to hear
how I feel,</b></font>

275
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ishimori?</b></font>

276
00:11:27,770 --> 00:11:29,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

277
00:11:29,770 --> 00:11:31,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I'm in love
with you, too.</b></font>

278
00:11:32,070 --> 00:11:33,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

279
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

280
00:11:37,070 --> 00:11:38,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

281
00:11:39,410 --> 00:11:41,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka whimpering]</b></font>

282
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:45,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka crying]</b></font>

283
00:11:48,330 --> 00:11:50,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] [sighs]
You're such a pain.</b></font>

284
00:11:50,590 --> 00:11:51,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on.</b></font>

285
00:11:51,750 --> 00:11:53,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you can't talk,
at least look at me.</b></font>

286
00:11:54,590 --> 00:11:57,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

287
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:00,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sobbing silently]</b></font>

288
00:12:00,430 --> 00:12:01,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

289
00:12:02,010 --> 00:12:03,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai exhales]</b></font>

290
00:12:05,980 --> 00:12:07,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey.
It's fine.</b></font>

291
00:12:08,350 --> 00:12:09,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The past eight months,</b></font>

292
00:12:10,060 --> 00:12:11,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've been slowly
falling in love.</b></font>

293
00:12:11,730 --> 00:12:13,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

294
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:14,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm serious about this.</b></font>

295
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:16,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay?</b></font>

296
00:12:16,950 --> 00:12:18,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...</b></font>

297
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:20,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

298
00:12:21,870 --> 00:12:23,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm losing control.</b></font>

299
00:12:23,620 --> 00:12:24,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The words are coming.</b></font>

300
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't hold them back!</b></font>

301
00:12:29,290 --> 00:12:30,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm in love with you!</b></font>

302
00:12:31,590 --> 00:12:33,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I love you so much!</b></font>

303
00:12:33,210 --> 00:12:34,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka sobs]</b></font>

304
00:12:34,460 --> 00:12:35,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know.</b></font>

305
00:12:35,670 --> 00:12:37,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Really, I love you.</b></font>

306
00:12:37,930 --> 00:12:38,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka sniffles]</b></font>

307
00:12:39,340 --> 00:12:40,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Yeah, I got it.</b></font>

308
00:12:40,930 --> 00:12:41,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You told me.</b></font>

309
00:12:42,510 --> 00:12:43,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka gasps]</b></font>

310
00:12:43,890 --> 00:12:45,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

311
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:47,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I fell for someone.</b></font>

312
00:12:49,350 --> 00:12:50,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm in love.</b></font>

313
00:12:52,810 --> 00:12:53,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not afraid.</b></font>

314
00:12:54,530 --> 00:12:55,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not anymore!</b></font>

315
00:12:57,530 --> 00:12:58,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now,</b></font>

316
00:12:58,650 --> 00:13:00,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll follow you anywhere.</b></font>

317
00:13:02,990 --> 00:13:05,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

318
00:13:06,830 --> 00:13:07,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[signal beeps]</b></font>

319
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:11,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

320
00:13:14,340 --> 00:13:16,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I finally told him how I felt.</b></font>

321
00:13:17,090 --> 00:13:18,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My heart's so full,</b></font>

322
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm worried it'll burst.</b></font>

323
00:13:21,970 --> 00:13:23,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
Kai! Mornin'!</b></font>

324
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:25,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Meetin' someone?</b></font>

325
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm trying to.</b></font>

326
00:13:26,810 --> 00:13:27,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
Oh.</b></font>

327
00:13:29,690 --> 00:13:31,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Good morning, Miura!</b></font>

328
00:13:31,940 --> 00:13:33,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who are you waiting for
on this beautiful day?</b></font>

329
00:13:34,230 --> 00:13:36,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're really gonna
make me say it's you?</b></font>

330
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:39,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

331
00:13:39,110 --> 00:13:40,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.</b></font>

332
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Your hair smells nice.</b></font>

333
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:45,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you just wash it?</b></font>

334
00:13:46,740 --> 00:13:47,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[shudders]</b></font>

335
00:13:48,370 --> 00:13:49,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

336
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:51,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Uh!
-[gasps]</b></font>

337
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh.</b></font>

338
00:13:54,130 --> 00:13:56,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka breathes shakily]</b></font>

339
00:13:56,550 --> 00:13:57,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai sighs]</b></font>

340
00:14:00,220 --> 00:14:01,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I never imagined</b></font>

341
00:14:01,470 --> 00:14:03,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the future would
look so bright.</b></font>

342
00:14:03,220 --> 00:14:05,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

343
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:06,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Sorry.</b></font>

344
00:14:06,930 --> 00:14:08,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] No.
It's fine!</b></font>

345
00:14:08,430 --> 00:14:10,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Shiraishi cheering]</b></font>

346
00:14:11,020 --> 00:14:12,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're holding hands!</b></font>

347
00:14:12,230 --> 00:14:14,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems like you two are getting
chummier by the day!</b></font>

348
00:14:15,150 --> 00:14:17,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>More than that. It looks like
you guys are in love!</b></font>

349
00:14:17,690 --> 00:14:18,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Careful!</b></font>

350
00:14:18,900 --> 00:14:19,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, we are.</b></font>

351
00:14:20,070 --> 00:14:21,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

352
00:14:21,860 --> 00:14:22,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nice!</b></font>

353
00:14:22,990 --> 00:14:24,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL]
What?!</b></font>

354
00:14:24,450 --> 00:14:25,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

355
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

356
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:28,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

357
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:31,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He just said it!</b></font>

358
00:14:32,250 --> 00:14:34,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What happened to our cute,
innocent Ishimori?</b></font>

359
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:35,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When did this start?</b></font>

360
00:14:35,710 --> 00:14:36,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How long have you two been</b></font>

361
00:14:36,630 --> 00:14:38,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>going out behind our backs,
anyway?</b></font>

362
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:39,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're gonna
shake her head right off!</b></font>

363
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think we're going out!</b></font>

364
00:14:42,090 --> 00:14:43,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He said you're in love,
didn't he?</b></font>

365
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How the heck
are you not going out yet?</b></font>

366
00:14:46,470 --> 00:14:48,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, no one said
anything about dating.</b></font>

367
00:14:48,930 --> 00:14:51,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People can go out
without making it official.</b></font>

368
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:52,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL]
Huh?</b></font>

369
00:14:52,180 --> 00:14:53,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka gasps]</b></font>

370
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:54,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But don't you wanna
make it official</b></font>

371
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and actually be his girlfriend?</b></font>

372
00:14:56,150 --> 00:14:57,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>More than anything!</b></font>

373
00:14:58,400 --> 00:14:59,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, of course.</b></font>

374
00:14:59,650 --> 00:15:01,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I figured...</b></font>

375
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:03,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there were still some steps
before that?</b></font>

376
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:04,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, like,</b></font>

377
00:15:05,570 --> 00:15:07,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what is dating, actually?</b></font>

378
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:11,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] Kai's the worst
first love she could have.</b></font>

379
00:15:11,620 --> 00:15:12,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
That's rough.</b></font>

380
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure it'll be okay!</b></font>

381
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:16,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The constant panic
is part of my girl's charm!</b></font>

382
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:18,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

383
00:15:19,210 --> 00:15:20,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
So, Miura.</b></font>

384
00:15:20,590 --> 00:15:21,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are we...</b></font>

385
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:23,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and what's next?</b></font>

386
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:28,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] So, uh...
I heard that you and Ishimori</b></font>

387
00:15:28,100 --> 00:15:29,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>aren't actually going out?</b></font>

388
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or that's what I hear
she's telling people, lately.</b></font>

389
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But what do you think?</b></font>

390
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Figures.</b></font>

391
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:39,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ishimori.</b></font>

392
00:15:39,690 --> 00:15:41,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

393
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Uh.
Yes?</b></font>

394
00:15:43,900 --> 00:15:45,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I'm calm.
So calm.</b></font>

395
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Kai?</b></font>

396
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why do you still call her
"Ishimori?"</b></font>

397
00:15:49,370 --> 00:15:51,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-That's kinda weird for you.
-Huh?</b></font>

398
00:15:51,370 --> 00:15:53,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] You usually
jump straight to first names,</b></font>

399
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:54,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even with people you just met.</b></font>

400
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:57,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Yeah, good point.
-[AYUMI] Huh?</b></font>

401
00:15:57,210 --> 00:15:58,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're still acting
formal with her,</b></font>

402
00:15:58,790 --> 00:15:59,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after all this time.</b></font>

403
00:16:00,290 --> 00:16:01,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Any reason?</b></font>

404
00:16:01,750 --> 00:16:02,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...</b></font>

405
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:03,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Tonbo laughs]</b></font>

406
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:05,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] Do you not know
her first name?</b></font>

407
00:16:06,970 --> 00:16:08,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Uka.
-[Uka gasps]</b></font>

408
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:09,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Was that okay?</b></font>

409
00:16:10,260 --> 00:16:11,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did I say it right?</b></font>

410
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

411
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:15,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Uh-oh. Someone check
if she's breathing.</b></font>

412
00:16:15,390 --> 00:16:17,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] But all he did
was just say your name.</b></font>

413
00:16:17,190 --> 00:16:18,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[school bell chimes]</b></font>

414
00:16:18,650 --> 00:16:20,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well.
Off to the assembly.</b></font>

415
00:16:20,810 --> 00:16:21,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>See you.</b></font>

416
00:16:22,650 --> 00:16:23,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

417
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:26,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] You positive
Ishimori's good for you?</b></font>

418
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:27,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Won't be much of a relationship</b></font>

419
00:16:27,700 --> 00:16:29,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if she takes off like that
all the time.</b></font>

420
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:32,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't expect anything else
from her right now.</b></font>

421
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not yet.</b></font>

422
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka panting]</b></font>

423
00:16:35,950 --> 00:16:37,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What's wrong with me?</b></font>

424
00:16:37,830 --> 00:16:39,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why am I like this?</b></font>

425
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes heavily]</b></font>

426
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA] I feel like
you should've waited</b></font>

427
00:16:42,210 --> 00:16:43,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before going public.</b></font>

428
00:16:44,130 --> 00:16:45,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Probably, yeah.</b></font>

429
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:46,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Why didn't you?</b></font>

430
00:16:47,090 --> 00:16:48,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey.
I was just excited.</b></font>

431
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:51,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] Wow, surprised
that even happens to you.</b></font>

432
00:16:51,890 --> 00:16:52,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Same here, man.</b></font>

433
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, then.
It might be a while still?</b></font>

434
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:57,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
That depends on her.</b></font>

435
00:16:57,310 --> 00:16:59,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And are you cool with that?</b></font>

436
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:00,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[inhales]
[groans]</b></font>

437
00:17:00,850 --> 00:17:02,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Of course not.</b></font>

438
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:04,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Haven't seen that face before.</b></font>

439
00:17:05,070 --> 00:17:06,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

440
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:08,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[water trickling]</b></font>

441
00:17:08,320 --> 00:17:09,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

442
00:17:09,530 --> 00:17:11,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've got tomorrow open,
if you've got the time.</b></font>

443
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:13,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What now?</b></font>

444
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He looked disappointed.</b></font>

445
00:17:16,830 --> 00:17:18,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did I already make him
sick of me?</b></font>

446
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:21,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He said we were in love
this morning.</b></font>

447
00:17:23,210 --> 00:17:25,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] I don't expect anything
else from her right now.</b></font>

448
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:26,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not yet.</b></font>

449
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

450
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:32,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
He should expect more.</b></font>

451
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:34,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold on, Miura!</b></font>

452
00:17:35,010 --> 00:17:36,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't give up on me!</b></font>

453
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:38,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

454
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:40,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT COUNCIL 1]
Kai, you're on duty today.</b></font>

455
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:41,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here's the script.</b></font>

456
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:42,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>STUDENT COUNCIL MEMBERS</b></font>

457
00:17:42,810 --> 00:17:43,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Mi...
Miura!</b></font>

458
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YURU] Hm?
-Uka?</b></font>

459
00:17:46,820 --> 00:17:47,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
Uh?</b></font>

460
00:17:47,940 --> 00:17:50,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes heavily]</b></font>

461
00:17:51,150 --> 00:17:53,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 1] Uh?
So, who's the plain girl?</b></font>

462
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:56,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keep up, man.
That's Kai's new girlfriend!</b></font>

463
00:17:56,950 --> 00:17:58,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 1] Oh.
Didn't know you had one.</b></font>

464
00:17:58,750 --> 00:18:00,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

465
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's because we're not
going out yet.</b></font>

466
00:18:03,330 --> 00:18:04,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 2] Yeah?
Bummer.</b></font>

467
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

468
00:18:07,590 --> 00:18:08,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I...</b></font>

469
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:09,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[shudders]</b></font>

470
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:13,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

471
00:18:15,390 --> 00:18:16,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I want to change that.</b></font>

472
00:18:17,810 --> 00:18:19,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-So, Miura.</b></font>

473
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:21,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please, will you
go out with me?</b></font>

474
00:18:21,850 --> 00:18:23,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all gasp]</b></font>

475
00:18:23,310 --> 00:18:25,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm struggling
to speak my mind.</b></font>

476
00:18:25,270 --> 00:18:26,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I feel nervous...
-[Kai gasps]</b></font>

477
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:28,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>...and I doubt that's gonna
change for a while.</b></font>

478
00:18:29,190 --> 00:18:30,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I still wanna try!</b></font>

479
00:18:31,110 --> 00:18:32,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT COUNCIL 1]
Okay, you're up.</b></font>

480
00:18:32,610 --> 00:18:34,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-No. Please don't go.
-[KAI] Uh...</b></font>

481
00:18:34,740 --> 00:18:35,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's okay!</b></font>

482
00:18:36,030 --> 00:18:38,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.
He has to open the assembly.</b></font>

483
00:18:38,290 --> 00:18:39,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Not his choice.
-Yep,</b></font>

484
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:41,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the student council said
today is his day.</b></font>

485
00:18:42,250 --> 00:18:44,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My timing is awful as always.</b></font>

486
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:47,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry.</b></font>

487
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:53,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on, line up already!</b></font>

488
00:18:53,090 --> 00:18:56,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

489
00:18:56,260 --> 00:18:59,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

490
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can't give up.</b></font>

491
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:11,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not now...</b></font>

492
00:19:11,570 --> 00:19:12,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when it's just beginning.</b></font>

493
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:14,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Rather,</b></font>

494
00:19:15,280 --> 00:19:17,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>not before it's even begun.</b></font>

495
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:19,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[microphone static]</b></font>

496
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:20,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 7]
Kai's opening today?</b></font>

497
00:19:20,990 --> 00:19:22,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 8]
That's perfect!</b></font>

498
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Start the day with some
eye candy! -No kidding.</b></font>

499
00:19:25,290 --> 00:19:26,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
All right, then.</b></font>

500
00:19:26,630 --> 00:19:28,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

501
00:19:28,210 --> 00:19:29,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Welcome.</b></font>

502
00:19:29,090 --> 00:19:30,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're about to
start the morning assembly.</b></font>

503
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:32,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'll stand strong.</b></font>

504
00:19:33,420 --> 00:19:34,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>On this...</b></font>

505
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:35,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and everything else!</b></font>

506
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:37,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I will!</b></font>

507
00:19:38,930 --> 00:19:40,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I want to be with you!</b></font>

508
00:19:41,850 --> 00:19:42,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ishimori.</b></font>

509
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would you please
go out with me?</b></font>

510
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:48,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want you to be my girlfriend.</b></font>

511
00:19:48,360 --> 00:19:49,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathes shakily]</b></font>

512
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:52,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anyway,</b></font>

513
00:19:52,150 --> 00:19:53,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>please refrain from talking.</b></font>

514
00:19:54,820 --> 00:19:56,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-That's all.
-Hold up!</b></font>

515
00:19:56,280 --> 00:19:57,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Did he just shoot his shot!
-Don't just leave!</b></font>

516
00:19:58,030 --> 00:19:59,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I can't refrain!
-[gasps]</b></font>

517
00:20:00,370 --> 00:20:02,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[female students clamoring]</b></font>

518
00:20:02,620 --> 00:20:04,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[sobbing]
-[MOMO] Aw, Marin. It's okay.</b></font>

519
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAGANO]
Hey, calm down.</b></font>

520
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:09,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

521
00:20:10,250 --> 00:20:11,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka!</b></font>

522
00:20:11,380 --> 00:20:12,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

523
00:20:13,590 --> 00:20:15,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI]
Come here. Miura!</b></font>

524
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:16,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's crazy!</b></font>

525
00:20:17,180 --> 00:20:18,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look at you go, Ishimori!</b></font>

526
00:20:18,930 --> 00:20:20,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kaede chuckles softly]</b></font>

527
00:20:20,140 --> 00:20:21,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SEKI]
Huh.</b></font>

528
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:22,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both chuckle softly]</b></font>

529
00:20:22,470 --> 00:20:23,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

530
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:24,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOTH]
Ah!</b></font>

531
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:27,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
You did it.</b></font>

532
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:30,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

533
00:20:30,860 --> 00:20:33,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE] Okay, okay!
Everyone settle down!</b></font>

534
00:20:33,820 --> 00:20:37,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I hope this doesn't bother you
on your first day, Midori.</b></font>

535
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:38,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.</b></font>

536
00:20:38,950 --> 00:20:40,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

537
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Tomoya chuckles softly]</b></font>

538
00:20:42,450 --> 00:20:45,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

539
00:20:45,580 --> 00:20:48,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka breathing heavily]</b></font>

540
00:20:54,420 --> 00:20:56,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I wonder
what's about to begin for us.</b></font>

541
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:58,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[male students laugh]</b></font>

542
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:00,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

543
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:03,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

544
00:21:04,810 --> 00:21:06,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I still feel uneasy,</b></font>

545
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it's okay.</b></font>

546
00:21:08,890 --> 00:21:10,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Something great is starting.</b></font>

547
00:21:11,150 --> 00:21:12,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles softly]</b></font>

548
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:14,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

549
00:21:15,530 --> 00:21:16,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With him!</b></font>

550
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:19,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

